msgstr ""

#: dist/admin/main.js:4014
msgid ""
"<b>Filter</b> (e.g. <i>Order - Items</i>), which you can use if\n"
"        you want to send email to selected group of customers."
msgstr ""

#: dist/admin/main.js:4015
msgid ""
"Finally, <b>Action</b> (e.g. <i>Send Email</i>),\n"
"              in which you can create your message to the recipient."
